QuestGuidance.Register("en",160,{
[5089]="70071771\n1\tFind the chieftains in Sul Madásh\tIrsinith has asked you to travel to Sul Madásh and speak with the chieftains there. They will want to know of the Pale Blight's effect on Amûma and Laivárth.\n2\tSpeak with Dáthlil\tYou found the chieftains of Sul Madásh. Speak with Dáthlil and bring her the news of the Pale Blight from her daughter, Irsinith.\n3\tSpeak with Ildimár\tYou found the chieftains of Sul Madásh. Dáthlil has asked you to speak with her husband Ildimár and learn more about the settlement.\n",
[5090]="70071772\n1\tLook out over the lands of Adagím\tIldimár has asked that you look out over the lands of Adagím from where they stand so you can see how bad the Pale Blight has ravaged the land.\n2\tSpeak with Ildimár\tYou have seen just how far the Pale Blight has spread through Adagím and how so little of it remains unspoiled. You should speak with Ildimár now that you know more of what they are up against.\n3\tSpeak with Faeron\tIldimár has told you that Rangers from the north arrived in Sul Madásh to fight back the Pale Blight and could likely use your help.\n",
[5091]="70071773\n1\tSpeak with Viznak about the serum\tFaeron has asked you to help the Rangers to craft a serum against the Pale Blight by assisting Viznak in concocting it.\n2\tGather blighted water (total: 5)\030Gather blighted mushrooms (total: 3)\030Gather blighted sap (total: 2)\030Gather bighted leaves (total: 5)\tViznak informed you about the plan for the Pale Blight potion and asked that you gather the needed ingredients from near Sul Madásh.\n3\tReturn to Viznak with the serum ingredients\tYou have gathered the requested ingredients for the potion. Return to Viznak in Sul Madásh so he can begin crafting the concoction.\n",
[5092]="70071774\n1\tSpeak with Viznak when you are ready to test the serum\tViznak is ready for you to test the serum that was crafted to protect against the Pale Blight in Adagím.\n2\tSpeak to Viznak\tSpeak with Viznak about the results of testing the serum.\n",
[5093]="7005739B\n1\tTalk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Vales of Anduin. You should talk to Grimbeorn.\n2\tTalk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Vales of Anduin. You should talk to Grimbeorn.\n3\tLight a candle for Threkmóth at the Carrock\tThe Carrock can be found in the Beorninglands. You should light a candle for Threkmóth.\n4\tTalk to Agátur at Limlók\tAgátur can be found at Limlók. You should talk to Agátur.\n5\tTravel to the path in Misthallow which leads to Ered Mithrin\tThe path towards Ered Mithrin can be found in Misthallow. You should travel to the start of this path.\n6\tTalk to Agátur in Misthallow\tAgátur can be found in Misthallow. You should talk to Agátur.\n7\tTalk to Agátur at Skarháld\tAgátur can be found at Skarháld. You should talk to Agátur.\n",
[5094]="70021D73\n1\tCadelhin is at Crug Cadelhin in the Lich Bluffs. You should talk to Cadelhin when you are ready to travel into Crug Fernvael to confront Cadelhin's father.\t\n2\tTalk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary\tLhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs. Following Fernvael's defeat, many shades have been released from their ancient curse. You should return to Lhudd with the news.\n",
[5095]="7003558F\n1\tPick up Aldstan's sword\tAldstan's sword sits beside him at the refugees' cave in the High Knolls, north of Byre Tor. You should collect Aldstan's sword to bury it with his son.\n2\tAsk Ránmald for a tribute to lay at her husband's grave\tRánmald can be found in the refugees' cave in the northern High Knolls. You should ask Ránmald if there is anything she wishes to bury with her husband.\n3\tCollect Ránmald's pendant\tRánmald's pendant can be found in the refugees' cave in the High Knolls. You should collect Ránmald's pendant.\n4\tFind Céolstan's body near Byre Tor\tCéolstan can be found between Byre Tor and the refugees' cave. You should find Céolstan, and lay him to rest.\n5\tLay Céolstan to rest\tCéolstan can be found between Byre Tor and the refugees' cave. You should lay Céolstan to rest.\n6\tReturn to Aldstan\tAldstan can be found in the refugees' cave in the northern High Knolls.\n",
[5096]="70068B65\n1\tTalk to Tarax on the other side of the Fathomwell\tTarax is across the Fathomwell from Hûmaz.\n2\tTalk to Hûmaz on the other side of the Fathomwell\tHûmaz is across the Fathomwell from Tarax.\n3\tTalk to Tarax on the other side of the Fathomwell\tTarax is across the Fathomwell from Hûmaz.\n4\tTalk to Hûmaz on the other side of the Fathomwell\tHûmaz is across the Fathomwell from Tarax.\n",
[5097]="70048C96\n1\tDefeat diseased swamp-boar\030Defeat plagued dire-wolf\030Defeat infectious plague-rat\030Defeat Agarnaith gore-crow\030Defeat swarming plague-flies\tAnimals can be found in southern Agarnaith. You should defeat one of each different animal you find.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[5098]="70053397\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tCalm frightened marsh-tenders in the Gladden Fields (total: 8)\tFrightened marsh-tenders can be found at Gilvamyr and Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. You have discovered some of the frightened marsh-tenders that Radagast encountered in his travels. You should try to calm their fears and aid them in tending the Gladden Fields.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have calmed many of the frightened marsh-tenders in the Gladden Fields.\n",
[5099]="70007F40\n1\tDefeat cave-claws (total: 6)\tCave-claws are found along the hill-side west of Edhelion, scattered near the entrance and within the Silver-deep. Orodlin asked you to defeat cave-claws found throughout Thorin's Gate and deliver the message that you have to Bogi at Frerin's Court.\n2\tTalk to Bogi\tBogi can be found in the centre of Thorin's Gate at Frerin's Court west of Edhelion in the centre of the valley.\n",
[5100]="70041469\n1\tSearch for the Corsair hideout to the north-west\tThe Corsairs' hideout can be found somewhere to the north-west of Hata Khezrat along the mountainside. Gorroch has asked you to track the Corsairs into the hills in hopes of disrupting them.\n2\tSearch for the cave the Corsairs mentioned as they fled\tThe Corsairs' hideout can be found in north-central Dor-en-Ernil along the mountainside. You have encountered two Corsairs fleeing south-east of Dol Brannor. You should search the nearby mountainside for their hideout.\n3\tSearch the cave for more Corsairs\tThe Corsairs' hideout can be found in northern central Dor-en-Ernil. You have found the Corsairs' cave and should now search it for any sign of Corsairs.\n4\tExamine a fallen Corsair\tThe slain Corsair can be found on the ground of the Corsair cave in north-central Dor-en-Ernil. You have found naught but slain Corsairs in the cave and should examine their bodies to determine what has occurred.\n",
[5101]="70026E93\n1\tCollect wild turnips (total: 10)\tWild turnips tend to grow in the fields south of Lhan Tarren. You should collect wild turnips to help bolster the food-stores in Lhan Tarren.\n2\tBring the wild turnips to Grigor\tGrigor resides in Lhan Tarren, worrying over the food-stores and the distressing thought of a future emergency. You should bring the turnips you gathered to Grigor.\n",
[5102]="7006B603\n1\tDefeat wild cats and collect their pelts (total: 6)\tServals and caracals can be found prowling about the rice fields of Ekagar in Ambarûl. You should defeat some and bring their pelts to Turizi.\n2\tBring the pelts to Turizi\tYou have defeated servals and caracals prowling about the rice fields of Ekagar. You should bring their pelts to Turizi behind the farmhouse.\n",
[5103]="7005475B\n1\tExecute the recipe for Nine Star Pie (total: 15)\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be found in your crafting panel. Bake up fifteen servings of Nine Star Pie.\n2\tTalk to Aesseledh\030Talk to the Cook's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[5104]="7005475A\n1\tBake potato-stuffed waybread (total: 5)\030Bake chicken-stuffed waybread (total: 5)\030Bake pork and fruit waybread (total: 5)\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be found in your crafting panel. Bake three different types of waybread, five pieces each.\n2\tTalk to Aesseledh\030Talk to the Cook's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[5105]="70054759\n1\tExecute the recipe for par-cooked vegetables (total: 25)\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be found in your crafting panel. Cook twenty-five servings of par-cooked vegetables.\n2\tTalk to Aesseledh\030Talk to the Cook's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[5106]="700546F2\n1\tExecute the recipe for waybread dough (total: 25)\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be found in your crafting panel. Prepare twenty-five portions of waybread dough.\n2\tTalk to Aesseledh\030Talk to the Cook's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[5107]="700596A5\n1\tCollect Wildwood moose meat (total: 8)\030Collect Wildwood boar meat (total: 8)\030Collect Wildwood bear meat (total: 8)\030Collected Wildwood Huorn bark (total: 8)\030Complete Wildwood Delicacy\tFeast ingredients can be found in the Wildwood. Minda Heathertoes needs help gathering ingredients for a grand feast.\n2\tTalk to Minda Heathertoes\tMinda is in a camp in the southern Wildwood. You should talk to Minda Heathertoes.\n",
[5108]="7003E460\n1\tDefeat Fangorn Hive-workers under rotting stumps (total: 20)\tGredbyg can be found under rotting stumps throughout southern Fangorn. The Huorn has expressed naught but contempt for the gredbyg chewing upon the trees of Fangorn. You should defeat them.\n2\tTalk to Quickbeam's Huorn\tYou have defeated many gredbyg and stopped them from causing more damage to Fangorn.\n",
[5109]="7006BF43\n1\tGather pristine feathers (total: 12)\tPaguri in Ub Nishir has asked you to gather feathers from birds in Urash Dâr so that she can replenish her stock of arrows.\n2\tReturned to Paguri with the pristine feathers\tBring the pristine feathers back to Paguri in Ub Nishir.\n",
[5110]="700088BA\n1\tReturn to Taskmaster Núrsufum at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect sun-touched tailfeathers (total: 6)\tSun-touched eagles are found throughout the Coldfells and sections of Arador's End. Taskmaster Núrsufum wants you to get him tailfeathers for his helm.\n",
[5111]="70001815\n1\tTalk to Orthonn at Ost Lagoros\tOrthonn is collecting herbs in the Kingsfell, likely at his camp in the ruins of Ost Lagoros north-west of Gatson's farm, some distance south and west of Othrikar. Hannar explained that his people did not know enough about hendrevail to know how to deal with them, since hunting them did not appear to work. He asked you to go speak with a hunter named Orthonn who might have some insights about the birds.\n2\tTalk to Hannar at Othrikar\tHannar is at Othrikar. You managed to find the Ranger who Hannar sent you to seek, and he suggested you look for the hendroval roosting ground. You should return to Hannar with this information.\n",
[5112]="70020BB3\n1\tCollect pristine feathers (total: 6)\tPristine feathers might be found in the nests of the crebain at Pluvun Gwern, north-east of Echad Saeradan. Amlan has asked you to collect pristine feathers to trade to the Algraig of Enedwaith.\n2\tBring the craban-feathers to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan\tSaeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith, south-west of Pluvun Gwern. Amlan told you to take the craban-feathers to Saeradan to be prepared for delivery to the Algraig.\n",
[5113]="70030470\n1\tKill a spying craban\tThe hill of Cracabor is the highest point in the Wold, and is located just north of the Twickenburg. You should climb Cracabor and collect feathers from the evil flock that has landed there.\n2\tCollect craban-feathers (total: 7)\tThe hill of Cracabor is the highest point in the Wold, and is located just north of the Twickenburg. You should climb Cracabor and collect feathers from the evil flock that has landed there.\n3\tBring the feathers to Sergeant Tidlac\tSergeant Tidlac is keeping watch on the road from the fort of Twickenburg, between Harwick and Floodwend. You should bring the feathers to Sergeant Tidlac.\n",
[5114]="70059779\n1\tCollect feathers in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tFeathers can be found on birds in the Wildwood. You should collect feathers.\n2\tPlace the feathers in a storage crate\tA storage crate can be found in either Trader's Wharf or Trestlebridge. You should place the feathers in a storage crate.\n",
[5115]="70050DF7\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tComplete: Featured Instance: Blood of the Black Serpent (cap level)\030Complete: Challenge: Fall of the Two Princes\tComplete the Tier 2 Challenge in the Blood of the Black Serpent instance.\n",
